OL,3,GNEWSANewborns to be tested for rare
OL,4,Acondition in trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FNewborn babies will be tested for
OL,7,FSpinal Muscular Atrophy (SMA) from
OL,8,FOctober in a national trial.
OL,10,FThe five-year study, led by Professor
OL,11,FLaurent Servais, a paediatric
OL,12,Fneuromuscular disease specialist at the
OL,13,FUniversity of Oxford, will investigate
OL,14,Fwhether adding SMA to the routine
OL,15,Fnewborn blood spot test is effective,
OL,16,Fpractical and cost-effective for the
OL,17,FNHS.
OL,19,FFormer Little Mix singer Jesy Nelson
OL,20,Fhad campaigned for every baby to be
OL,21,Ftested after her twins were diagnosed
OL,22,Fwith SMA at six months old.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
